msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"I told you we don't want any ice cream! Uncle Kaz is gonna say the same "
"thing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"Dammit, kid, you're not listenin' to the words comin' out of my mouth! I "
"need to see a guy named Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Wait... Are you Kazuma Kiryu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Yeah. What do you want with one of my kids? I don't appreciate people "
"pressuring them to buy ice cream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"Kazuma Kiryu! I have come for you! Yeah, that's right. I know you know "
"Kamiyama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"I trained Kamiyama in the use of a bunch of the weapons he carries. I'm "
"kind of a master at 'em. A weapons master, you might say. Name's Yonashiro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Kamiyama told me all about how you were lookin' for new and exciting ways "
"to bust skulls, so here I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Why would a master come all this way at the request of his pupil?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, you're a little suspicious. Understandable. But I'm not a rich "
"dude. I spend most of my time selling ice cream on the beach."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"Kamiyama is my pupil, but he also sells me weapons at a discount 'cause I'm "
"such a great guy. And because I'm such a great guy, I can't refuse him when "
"he asks me to do something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "(So this is Kamiyama's weapons master? Maybe I should have him teach me.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Okay, I'll take you up on that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Yesss! I was worried you were gonna chicken out. Come find me on the beach. "
"If you're man enough, that is!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Got it. I'll see you down there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Sorry, but I'm a little busy right now. Let's do it another time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "<Italic>What</Italic>!? Too busy to learn how to bust skulls!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Hey, I understand. The power weighs heavy on many a fighter. I'll be down "
"at the beach when you've worked up the courage to come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Got it. I'll see you down there when I'm ready."
msgstr ""

